| sonusear.co.nz | `_dmarc` | TXT | `v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:dmarc@sonusear.co.nz; fo=1` | ☐ add |
| lapelle.co.nz | `@` | TXT | `v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com -all` | ✅ |
| lapelle.co.nz | `google._domainkey` | TXT | *(from Google Admin — set, signing confirmed)* | ✅ |
